1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
AI video workflows lose the connection between the creative plan, model run, generated asset, and successful retry. Jingci keeps that chain inspectable.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Start with one idea. Jingci diagnoses generation risks before model spend, then offers safe, stylish, and cinematic directions.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:01:00,000
DirectorKit turns the selected direction into an execution package. This public judge demo uses deterministic local data: no external model call and no cloud write.

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Runway gen4.5 generated this five-second 1280x720 H.264 shot during an approved private verification.

5
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:47,000
Separately, Genblaze stored the MP4 and provenance manifest in Backblaze B2, read them back, verified digests and lineage, then deleted the two scoped test objects. These were two evidence-preserving phases, not one atomic transaction. This does not claim public B2 serving or durable retention.

6
00:01:47,000 --> 00:02:05,000
The visible failure path is an offline Fixture. It proves retry and parent-lineage behavior, not general provider reliability.

7
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:27,000
Jingci Provenance Vault: direct the shot, generate it, prove it, and improve the next run.
